exercises permit you to kiss me?

258
00:11:52,089 --> 00:11:53,118
- Oh not exactly.

259
00:11:53,118 --> 00:11:55,257
This is for comfort.

260
00:11:55,257 --> 00:11:56,138
And this.

261
