380
00:15:37,923 --> 00:15:39,587
- [Tom] Ethel?

381
00:15:39,587 --> 00:15:41,912
Yes. (mumbling)

382
00:15:41,912 --> 00:15:42,745
Yes.

383
00:15:42,745 --> 00:15:43,578
Yes.

